If the customer asks to change or cancel a recorded promise: say they can change it in the Freya Bank mobile app.
If the customer now asks for a new payment plan or lower instalments: call transfer_to_agent with queue restructuring and add NO notes. If they insist on a human after one offer to help: transfer_to_agent with queue general, no notes.
